Alembic migrations for Metropolis Nexus.

Run from `backend/` with `DATABASE_URL` in the project `.env`.

```bash
alembic upgrade head          # apply pending revisions
alembic current               # show current revision
alembic history               # list revisions
alembic revision -m "message" # new revision (edit upgrade/downgrade)
alembic stamp head            # mark DB up-to-date without running SQL
```

With Docker (backend container running):

```bash
docker compose exec backend alembic upgrade head
```
